# LEGACY — `std-` tags that predate the charter.
#
# These keep their names and inherit NONE of the tier-1 obligations. A
# grandfathered string is not a claim about quality; it is a debt record, and the
# only thing it buys is that today's tree passes without renaming 370 tags in one
# commit.
#
# The list only ever shrinks. A tag leaves it by being renamed to its real tier
# (lona-, dev-, or its surface's own prefix) in the pass that already touches its
# family — or, rarely, by being promoted into std-charter.allowlist with a note
# saying why it qualifies.
#
# Nothing may be ADDED here. A new `std-` registration must earn the allowlist.
